     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap FREncounterLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"en-FREncounterLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"en-hcFREncounterLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Group 1 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"StructureDefinition-fr-lm-encounter.html\">Logical model - FR LM Encounter</a> to <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-rencontre.html\">CDA - FR Rencontre</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMEncounter</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">FRCDARencontre</td><td/></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMEncounter.header.identifier</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">FRCDARencontre.id</td><td/></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMEncounter.header.status</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">FRCDARencontre.statusCode</td><td/></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMEncounter.header.author[x]</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">FRCDARencontre.author</td><td/></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMEncounter.participant</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">FRCDARencontre.participant</td><td/></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMEncounter.type</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">FRCDARencontre.code</td><td/></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMEncounter.period</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">FRCDARencontre.effectiveTime</td><td/></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMEncounter.priority</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">FRCDARencontre.priorityCode</td><td/></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMEncounter.participant</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">FRCDARencontre.participant:autresParticipants</td><td/></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMEncounter.serviceProvider</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">FRCDARencontre.performer.assignedEntity.representedOrganization</td><td/></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMEncounter.referringProfessional</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">FRCDARencontre.performer</td><td/></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMEncounter.basedOn[x]</td><td colspan=\"5\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">Aucune correspondance explicite de basedOn[x] dans le profil CDA FRCDARencontre.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMEncounter.reason[x]</td><td colspan=\"5\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">Aucune correspondance expli